      "text": "The proper way to work out how a building carries its loads is finite-element analysis very accurate, but about a minute per design.",
      "start": 9.22,
      "end": 16.1
    },
    {
      "text": "Way too slow for a loop that runs millions of times.",
      "start": 16.319,
      "end": 18.819
    },
    {
      "text": "So Patrick trained an AI model to just predict the same result.",
      "start": 20.34,
      "end": 23.419
